<!doctype lake><title>教案10-函数</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="fixed" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><h1 data-lake-id="c8K3K" id="c8K3K"><span data-lake-id="u3131dfd2" id="u3131dfd2">1.函数概念</span></h1><p data-lake-id="uf2d3849a" id="uf2d3849a"><span data-lake-id="uf1307104" id="uf1307104" class="lake-fontsize-12">在C语言中，函数意味着功能模块。一个典型的C语言程序，就是由一个个的功能模块拼接而成的整体。也因为如此，C语言被称为模块化语言。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u193d5837" id="u193d5837"><span data-lake-id="u9df9a285" id="u9df9a285" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="u4d31edb1" id="u4d31edb1"><span data-lake-id="u70c0d789" id="u70c0d789" class="lake-fontsize-12">对于函数的使用者，可以简单的将函数理解为黑箱子，使用者只管按照规定给黑箱一些输入，就会得到一些输出，而不必要理会黑箱子里面的运行细节。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u13d4e3df" id="u13d4e3df"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735795900162-efbdc683-d6a3-41fb-b2b3-e907913b27a0.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u73a5ed6e-55f1-4a5b-9119-cd55a04b1f5%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u1a5076b9-7fac-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A523.5%2C%22height%22%3A182%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A50782%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1047%2C%22originHeight%22%3A363%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22search%22%3A%22%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%20%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%20%E9%BB%91%E7%AE%B1%E5%AD%90%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22x%22%3A138%2C%22y%22%3A56%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A53%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A785%2C%22y%22%3A63%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A57%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A436%2C%22y%22%3A178%2C%22width%22%3A170%2C%22height%22%3A63%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E9%BB%91%E7%AE%B1%E5%AD%90%22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23b7b7b7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u7efd2c2e%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ue2771b5a" id="ue2771b5a"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735795915568-403bcb17-3f02-47d3-9bd2-90b8943bf32a.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uecd54d3c-41cf-4f3e-9f3a-42ee1cc3a16%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u1a5076b9-7fac-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A397%2C%22height%22%3A299%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A59221%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A794%2C%22originHeight%22%3A598%2C%22ratio%22%3A2%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e8e8e8%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u280de30d%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u8c7174c8" id="u8c7174c8"><span data-lake-id="u7593892d" id="u7593892d" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">对于函数的设计者，最重要的工作是封装，封装意味着对外提供服务并隐藏细节。对于一个封装良好的函数而言，其对外提供服务的接口应当是简洁的，内部功能应当是明确的。</span></p><p data-lake-id="8a6040386ab25a35d249f6f301ce5261" id="8a6040386ab25a35d249f6f301ce5261" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u5096d299" id="u5096d299" class="lake-fontsize-12">函数简单来说就是一连串语句，这些语句被 组合在一起，并被指定了一个名字。虽然“函数”这个术语来自数 学，但是C语言的函数不完全等同于数学函数。在C语言中，函数不一 定要有参数，也不一定要计算数值。</span></p><p data-lake-id="fbd908d7b152f2d761ad8913fd504b10" id="fbd908d7b152f2d761ad8913fd504b10" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560133778-248b5842-1493-4144-a915-b6e15b860073.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A265%2C%22height%22%3A209%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A500%2C%22originHeight%22%3A395%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f5f5f5%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OsZVA%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ab35ffb7133b7d0a9b62d0d88ace1ffc" id="ab35ffb7133b7d0a9b62d0d88ace1ffc" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560134085-5c19b52c-0e16-42f9-a74d-5c39db86d838.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A218%2C%22height%22%3A208%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1080%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1030%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23cdcdcd%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bkt3d%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="a5700610e2b1d4b67f457c8e53dd9253" id="a5700610e2b1d4b67f457c8e53dd9253" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ucbaadb50" id="ucbaadb50" class="lake-fontsize-12">柯西收敛</span></p><p data-lake-id="0445fda64ee67168d084f15c99318fdf" id="0445fda64ee67168d084f15c99318fdf" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u7d1c3591" id="u7d1c3591" class="lake-fontsize-12">函数是C程序的构建块。每个函数本质上是一个自带声明和语句的小程 序。可以利用函数把程序划分成小块，这样便于人们理解和修改程 序。由于不必重复编写要多次使用的代码，函数可以使编程不那么单 调乏味。</span></p><p data-lake-id="bbaf055c45a0b7b7da9bf8236da8b2b3" id="bbaf055c45a0b7b7da9bf8236da8b2b3" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u2837a687" id="u2837a687" class="lake-fontsize-12">此外，函数可以复用：一个函数最初可能是某个程序的一部 分，但可以将其用于其他程序中。</span></p><p data-lake-id="426da1cd4b640b927b8a12e59c683cf8" id="426da1cd4b640b927b8a12e59c683cf8"><span data-lake-id="u3fdb6e51" id="u3fdb6e51" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="e4b5a8f8b7d691c4a39af080295b1eb1" id="e4b5a8f8b7d691c4a39af080295b1eb1" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u525a45d7" id="u525a45d7" class="lake-fontsize-12">到目前为止，我们的程序都只是由一个main 函数构成的。本章将学 习如何编写除main 函数以外的其他函数，并更加深入地了解main 函数本身。</span></p><p data-lake-id="dee4367ba99873d3ab2b49749cb09d4a" id="dee4367ba99873d3ab2b49749cb09d4a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560134312-54692f44-cd28-41c3-802a-323aae10f149.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A144%2C%22height%22%3A202%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A686%2C%22originHeight%22%3A960%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9fbf4%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZSBZi%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id="bRwuH" id="bRwuH"><span data-lake-id="u8b120c55" id="u8b120c55">2.函数的定义和调用</span></h1><h2 data-lake-id="sGV63" id="sGV63"><span data-lake-id="u9eb37eee" id="u9eb37eee">2.1 函数的定义</span></h2><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%90%8D%E7%A7%B0(%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B01%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B02%EF%BC%8C.......)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E4%BD%93%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%E5%80%BC%EF%BC%9B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Tenhr%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><ul list="u8250f869"><li fid="ub760efce" data-lake-id="u641c49f5" id="u641c49f5"><span data-lake-id="u540dfaf9" id="u540dfaf9" class="lake-fontsize-12">返回类型：函数不能返回数组，但关于返回类型没有其他限制，当函数的返回类型为 void 时，表示该函数不返回任何数据。</span></li><li fid="ub760efce" data-lake-id="ud11d8b86" id="ud11d8b86"><span data-lake-id="ubf980698" id="ubf980698" class="lake-fontsize-12">形式参数：函数名后边有一串形式参数列表。 需要在每个形式参数的前面说 明其类型，形式参数间用逗号进行分隔。当函数的参数列表为 void 时，表示该函数不需要任何参数。</span></li><li fid="ub760efce" data-lake-id="u6439a5a4" id="u6439a5a4"><span data-lake-id="u05a13951" id="u05a13951" class="lake-fontsize-12">函数体：函数体可以包含声明和语句，函数体内声明的变量专属于此函数，其他函数不能对这些变量进行检 查或修改</span></li><li fid="ub760efce" data-lake-id="uf4a5653e" id="uf4a5653e"><span data-lake-id="u7d9911d8" id="u7d9911d8" class="lake-fontsize-12">返回类型：关键字 return 表示退出函数。①若函数头中规定有返回数据类型，则 return 需携带一个类型与之匹配的数据；②若函数头中规定返回类型为 void，则 return 不需携带参数。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4790ac87" id="u4790ac87"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22ai3Zv%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="u8a58530f" id="u8a58530f" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u6d2bb127" id="u6d2bb127"><span data-lake-id="u13623991" id="u13623991" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">没有返回值没有参数的函数实现</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnvoid%20huamei(void)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%E6%A4%8D%E5%8F%91%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%B7%E5%8B%BF%E6%89%93%E6%89%B0%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E4%B8%BB%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%B6%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BB%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cnint%20main(int%20argc%2C%20char%20const%20*argv%5B%5D)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20()%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%E8%BF%9B%E5%85%A5%E6%AD%A4%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%B9%B6%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%5Cn%20%20%20%20huamei()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GGlli%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="u48b7b840" id="u48b7b840"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF2%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A5%2C%22id%22%3A%22yZjqP%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="u75115fcb" id="u75115fcb" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span><span data-lake-id="u1d6c5f12" id="u1d6c5f12" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">没有返回值有参数的函数</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E5%AD%90%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cnvoid%20basketGround(char%20*tName)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25s%E6%AD%A3%E5%9C%A8%E6%89%93%E7%AF%AE%E7%90%83%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2CtName)%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%B0%E5%80%BC%E7%9B%B8%E5%8A%A0%5Cnvoid%20Add(int%20a%2C%20int%20b)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%2B%25d%3D%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Ca%2Cb%2Ca%2Bb)%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E4%B8%BB%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cnint%20main(int%20argc%2C%20char%20const%20*argv%5B%5D)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20Name%5B%5D%20%3D%20%5C%22jack%5C%22%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20Name%E4%B8%BA%E5%AE%9E%E5%8F%82%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%B0%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%A8%E9%80%97%E5%8F%B7%E9%9A%94%E5%BC%80%5Cn%20%20%20%20basketGround(Name)%3B%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20Add(10%2C20)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SwwGs%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="u4ab70192" id="u4ab70192"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF3%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A0%2C%22id%22%3A%22k85c2%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="u332c367c" id="u332c367c" class="lake-fontsize-12">：有返回值有参数</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%B0%E5%80%BC%E7%9B%B8%E5%8A%A0%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E5%B0%86%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%5Cnfloat%20Add(int%20a%2C%20float%20b)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20a%2Bb%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnint%20main(int%20argc%2C%20char%20const%20*argv%5B%5D)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20a%20%3D%2010%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20float%20f%20%3D%2010.5%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20float%20ret%20%3D%20Add(a%2Cf)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25.2f%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cret)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22q5dzn%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h2 data-lake-id="DbMYN" id="DbMYN"><span data-lake-id="u35b9ff7d" id="u35b9ff7d">2.2 函数的调用和声明</span></h2><p data-lake-id="2978060197a1aff4eb726cbf1c0b99cf" id="2978060197a1aff4eb726cbf1c0b99cf"><span data-lake-id="u0fa29838" id="u0fa29838" class="lake-fontsize-12">函数调用由函数名和跟随其后的实际参数列表组成 </span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2F%20x%2Cy%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%E7%94%B1%E5%AE%9E%E5%8F%82%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%5Cnint%20max(int%20x%2C%20int%20y)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20z%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20z%20%3D%20x%3Ey%20%3F%20x%20%3A%20y%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20z%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnint%20main(void)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20a%20%3D%201%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20b%20%3D%202%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20m%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20m%20%3D%20max(a%2C%20b)%3B%20%20%20%20%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22y3byO%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="794a6d0df5a02ec083f295ee57f144b1" id="794a6d0df5a02ec083f295ee57f144b1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560134933-fa8b8a9b-9f4e-4982-8459-111d3790de0b.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A482%2C%22height%22%3A205%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A954%2C%22originHeight%22%3A405%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f5f5f5%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dRARY%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="443078ba800cdb3c789614175e9cd8c0" id="443078ba800cdb3c789614175e9cd8c0"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u815bd94e" id="u815bd94e" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u1f16f656" id="u1f16f656" class="lake-fontsize-12">C语言并没有要求函数的定义必须放置在调用点之前，如果定义放在调用点之后的话，那么编译器是不知道这个函数的参数类型的，也不知道返回类型是什么。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u742bbdba" id="u742bbdba"><span data-lake-id="u1fe7b680" id="u1fe7b680" class="lake-fontsize-12">为了避免定义前调用的问题。</span></p><ul list="u456faf80"><li fid="u6e40475f" data-lake-id="u765e1db0" id="u765e1db0"><span data-lake-id="ubaef8f7d" id="ubaef8f7d" class="lake-fontsize-12">一种方法是使每个函数的定义都出现在 其调用之前。</span></li><li fid="u6e40475f" data-lake-id="ue90e4146" id="ue90e4146"><span data-lake-id="ufd4f0f4e" id="ufd4f0f4e" class="lake-fontsize-12">另一种方法是在调用前声明每个函 数。函数声明 （function declaration）使得编译器可以先对函数 进行概要浏览，而函数的完整定义以后再给出。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="eb6cc31d0b6dc50d99ec800357db3fe3" id="eb6cc31d0b6dc50d99ec800357db3fe3"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A1%2C%22id%22%3A%22QTGgw%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="u979ebac5" id="u979ebac5" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u677f3c98" id="u677f3c98"><span data-lake-id="u7ea588ac" id="u7ea588ac" class="lake-fontsize-12">函数名前面为返回值的类型，哪怕此函数没有返回值，也要写上void </span></p><ul list="u400fcabf"><li fid="ub6f2d080" data-lake-id="u9a720952" id="u9a720952"><span data-lake-id="u809e9d92" id="u809e9d92" class="lake-fontsize-12">	 函数的返回类型要顶格</span></li><li fid="ub6f2d080" data-lake-id="u8f832e39" id="u8f832e39"><span data-lake-id="ua0dc1f98" id="ua0dc1f98" class="lake-fontsize-12">	 函数返回类型与函数名空一格</span></li><li fid="ub6f2d080" data-lake-id="u9064d402" id="u9064d402"><span data-lake-id="u7dc40fa2" id="u7dc40fa2" class="lake-fontsize-12">	 函数参数要写(),哪怕里面没有任何内容，如果没有内容最好这样写void func(void)</span></li><li fid="ub6f2d080" data-lake-id="u3e6f223d" id="u3e6f223d"><span data-lake-id="u1dbc957b" id="u1dbc957b" class="lake-fontsize-12">	 函数调用者调用子函数的时候，可以不接收返回值</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1e1c6ca9" id="u1e1c6ca9"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u6527657e" id="u6527657e"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E7%BB%83%E4%B9%A0%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22CLJdO%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="u8cc4dd13" id="u8cc4dd13" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub76468d4" id="ub76468d4"><span data-lake-id="u63dde4e4" id="u63dde4e4" class="lake-fontsize-12">设计加减乘除取余接口函数，并实现将结果返回到主函数，并输出</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HYyEC%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="u4f64382d" id="u4f64382d"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u3441c8ce" id="u3441c8ce"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A3%2C%22id%22%3A%22pPRmD%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="ufa5a874f" id="ufa5a874f" class="lake-fontsize-12">:</span></p><p data-lake-id="uaed1e9c5" id="uaed1e9c5"><span data-lake-id="uf156096d" id="uf156096d" class="lake-fontsize-12">大括号表示函数的工作范围，如果离开此范围，数据就不属于此函数管辖</span></p><p data-lake-id="u64dfe9d8" id="u64dfe9d8"><span data-lake-id="u0cbe770e" id="u0cbe770e" class="lake-fontsize-12">	 函数不能在main(){}里面实现,虽然不会报错，如果不调用，这个子函数是不会被执行的</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub4c08136" id="ub4c08136"><span data-lake-id="u44890f6f" id="u44890f6f" class="lake-fontsize-12">	 所有函数的实现都在主函数外面实现</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2F%20%E8%AF%AD%E6%B3%95%E6%B2%A1%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%8C%E7%BC%96%E7%A8%8B%E8%A7%84%E8%8C%83%E6%9C%89%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%8C%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E8%BF%99%E4%B9%88%E5%86%99%5Cn%5Ctint%20main()%2F%2F%20%E4%B8%BB%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cn%5Ct%7B%5Cn%5Ct%5Ctvoid%20func()%20%2F%2F%20%E5%AD%90%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%7B%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%5Ctprintf(%5C%22func%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%7D%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%5Cn%5Ct%5Ctfunc()%3B%5Cn%5Ct%7D%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ct%2F%2F%20%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%86%99%E6%B3%95%E6%98%AF%E5%B0%86%E5%AD%90%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E6%94%BE%E5%88%B0%E4%B8%BB%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%A4%96%E9%9D%A2%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%5Cn%5Ctvoid%20func()%5Cn%5Ct%7B%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%5Cn%5Ct%7D%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ctint%20main()%5Cn%5Ct%7B%5Cn%5Ct%5Ctfunc()%3B%5Cn%5Ct%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vLRZK%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h1 data-lake-id="ao22Z" id="ao22Z"><span data-lake-id="ufa20bdf9" id="ufa20bdf9">3.实参 与形参</span></h1><p data-lake-id="f13c304a15d899c15f3d411430dd4c2e" id="f13c304a15d899c15f3d411430dd4c2e"><span data-lake-id="u7f8b131a" id="u7f8b131a" class="lake-fontsize-12">复习下形式参数和实际参数：</span></p><ul list="u78868596"><li fid="ubef645f4" data-lake-id="uad8f9583" id="uad8f9583"><span data-lake-id="u38701c02" id="u38701c02" class="lake-fontsize-12">形式参数 （parameter）出现在函数定义中，它们以假名字来表示函数调用时 需要提供的值</span></li><li fid="ubef645f4" data-lake-id="u3db8a5a6" id="u3db8a5a6"><span data-lake-id="ue4b0bb95" id="ue4b0bb95" class="lake-fontsize-12">实际参数 （argument）是出现在函数调用中的表达 式</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="cd6710a475f8dcfadc7b1566d67e9087" id="cd6710a475f8dcfadc7b1566d67e9087"><span data-lake-id="ufb4251f3" id="ufb4251f3" class="lake-fontsize-12">注意：</span></p><ul list="u28ea664d"><li fid="uea206593" data-lake-id="u6a2d5da3" id="u6a2d5da3"><span data-lake-id="u1dbc8158" id="u1dbc8158" class="lake-fontsize-12">实参于形参的类型和个数必须一一对应。</span></li><li fid="uea206593" data-lake-id="u4390f8fd" id="u4390f8fd"><span data-lake-id="u5a0b7c70" id="u5a0b7c70" class="lake-fontsize-12">形参的值由实参初始化。</span></li><li fid="uea206593" data-lake-id="u1c63d1d8" id="u1c63d1d8"><span data-lake-id="u2a060e5d" id="u2a060e5d" class="lake-fontsize-12">形参与实参位于不同的内存区域，彼此独立。</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="POyk0" id="POyk0"><span data-lake-id="ufdc1c0a4" id="ufdc1c0a4">3.1 指针作为实参</span></h2><p data-lake-id="udf55fa16" id="udf55fa16"><span data-lake-id="ued92e07d" id="ued92e07d" class="lake-fontsize-12">demo：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u2f40cf0b" id="u2f40cf0b"><span data-lake-id="u549629ce" id="u549629ce" class="lake-fontsize-12">如果我想实现两个整数交换，该怎么写</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22void%20swap(int%20a%2Cint%20b)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20temp%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20temp%3Da%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20a%3Db%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20b%3Dtemp%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20a%2Cb%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20a%3D10%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20b%3D20%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20swap(a%2Cb)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22a%3A%25d%5C%5Cnb%3A%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Ca%2Cb)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VQh6e%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="642532cd0e51301583a51a05377a43de" id="642532cd0e51301583a51a05377a43de" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="uf1e08d73" id="uf1e08d73" class="lake-fontsize-12">指针提供了此问题的解决方法：不再传递变量x 作为函数的实际参 数，而是提供&amp;x ，即x的地址</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20a%2Cb%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20a%3D10%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20b%3D20%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0a%E3%80%81b%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%E4%BA%A4%E6%8D%A2%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20swap(%26a%2C%26b)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22a%3A%25d%5C%5Cnb%3A%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Ca%2Cb)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnvoid%20swap(int%20*a%2Cint%20*b)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20temp%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20temp%3D*a%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20*a%3D*b%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20*b%3Dtemp%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z3qmq%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="38fd473bf60e131341c6377a6fed9c59" id="38fd473bf60e131341c6377a6fed9c59"><span data-lake-id="u860e3b6b" id="u860e3b6b" class="lake-fontsize-12">用指针作为函数的实际参数实际上不新鲜，实际上我们很早就已经在 scanf 函数调用中使用过了</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20i%3B%5Cn...%5Cnscanf(%5C%22%25d%5C%22%2C%20%26i)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uKsiz%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="95edeef82c5869a52de0b1e333ef1b3c" id="95edeef82c5869a52de0b1e333ef1b3c"><span data-lake-id="ue031b2d4" id="ue031b2d4" class="lake-fontsize-12">必须把&amp; 放在i 的前面以便给scanf 函数传递指向i 的指针，指针 会告诉scanf 函数把读取的值放在哪里。如果没有&amp; 运算符，传递 给scanf 函数的将是i 的</span><span data-lake-id="u9e4f8e02" id="u9e4f8e02" class="lake-fontsize-12">值</span><span data-lake-id="u49943af2" id="u49943af2" class="lake-fontsize-12">。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u8cb1c951" id="u8cb1c951"><br></p><p data-lake-id="3268daaa6513cb2fa057d9712fc938ef" id="3268daaa6513cb2fa057d9712fc938ef"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560135932-21e1fb94-7f05-41c7-a1e6-b9ce5e06a88a.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A390%2C%22height%22%3A178%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A690%2C%22originHeight%22%3A315%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23a5a7a4%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MDEvd%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id="NDN6x" id="NDN6x"><span data-lake-id="u17fa267a" id="u17fa267a">4.作用域</span></h1><p data-lake-id="d35e0a168975d44953d2ca8cab068804" id="d35e0a168975d44953d2ca8cab068804"><span data-lake-id="u321fc024" id="u321fc024" class="lake-fontsize-12">所谓作用域（Scope），就是变量的有效范围。本节知识还会在”内存管理“中提到。</span></p><p data-lake-id="4aa77a61820b4c0384df6d11f2e249f8" id="4aa77a61820b4c0384df6d11f2e249f8"><span data-lake-id="uefaa78c6" id="uefaa78c6" class="lake-fontsize-12">C语言中所有的变量都有自己的作用域。决定变量作用域的是变量的定义位置。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="UVpTX" id="UVpTX"><span data-lake-id="u940f0d76" id="u940f0d76">4.1 局部变量</span></h2><p data-lake-id="cb06d51c82eead6478cb489dec6e4d32" id="cb06d51c82eead6478cb489dec6e4d32"><span data-lake-id="ub6382bdc" id="ub6382bdc" class="lake-fontsize-12">定义在函数内部的变量称为局部变量（Local Variable）</span></p><p data-lake-id="b22425198f7c60486759055b807c5970" id="b22425198f7c60486759055b807c5970"><span data-lake-id="u72835caf" id="u72835caf" class="lake-fontsize-12">它的作用域仅限于函数内部， 离开该函数后就是无效的，再使用就会报错</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20f1(int%20a)%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20b%2Cc%3B%20%20%2F%2Fa%2Cb%2Cc%E4%BB%85%E5%9C%A8%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0f1()%E5%86%85%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20m%2Cn%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20a%2Bb%2Bc%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cnint%20main()%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20m%2Cn%3B%20%20%2F%2Fm%2Cn%E4%BB%85%E5%9C%A8%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0main()%E5%86%85%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22a26aV%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="81eed7f92bc8901ec35e49e23b65bc57" id="81eed7f92bc8901ec35e49e23b65bc57"><span data-lake-id="ue2d3f84c" id="ue2d3f84c" class="lake-fontsize-12">注意：</span></p><ul list="u58af241a"><li fid="ue81b9cec" data-lake-id="u6bda597d" id="u6bda597d"><span data-lake-id="uf6d9f596" id="uf6d9f596" class="lake-fontsize-12">在 main 函数中定义的变量也是局部变量，只能在 main 函数中使用；同时，main 函数中也不能使用其它函数中定义的变量。main 函数也是一个函数，与其它函数地位平等。</span></li><li fid="ue81b9cec" data-lake-id="u0cb6916c" id="u0cb6916c"><span data-lake-id="ueb8439fc" id="ueb8439fc" class="lake-fontsize-12">形参变量、在函数体内定义的变量都是局部变量。</span><span data-lake-id="u70d0d4cb" id="u70d0d4cb" class="lake-fontsize-12">实参给形参传值的过程也就是给局部变量赋值的过程。</span></li><li fid="ue81b9cec" data-lake-id="u522f865f" id="u522f865f"><span data-lake-id="ua2d416d9" id="ua2d416d9" class="lake-fontsize-12">可以在不同的函数中使用相同的变量名，它们表示不同的数据，分配不同的内存，互不干扰，也不会发生混淆。</span></li><li fid="ue81b9cec" data-lake-id="u888f15f6" id="u888f15f6"><span data-lake-id="u215b9398" id="u215b9398" class="lake-fontsize-12">在语句块中也可定义变量，它的作用域只限于当前语句块。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="df305145c0fe97a8099e3c34b2df8aad" id="df305145c0fe97a8099e3c34b2df8aad"><span data-lake-id="u693299f8" id="u693299f8" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="nzaGf" id="nzaGf"><span data-lake-id="udb808e8b" id="udb808e8b">4.2 全局变量</span></h2><p data-lake-id="d3762ef34a6172d788fb5ddf37092ac6" id="d3762ef34a6172d788fb5ddf37092ac6" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="uca362f77" id="uca362f77" class="lake-fontsize-12">在所有函数外部定义的变量称为全局变量（Global Variable），</span></p><p data-lake-id="26f0c8ce768ac80cb334509608dc739d" id="26f0c8ce768ac80cb334509608dc739d" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u251e3282" id="u251e3282" class="lake-fontsize-12">它的作用域默认是整个程序，也就是所有的源文件，如果给全局变量加上 static 关键字，它的作用域就变成了当前文件，在其它文件中就无效了(</span><span data-lake-id="uca016000" id="uca016000" class="lake-fontsize-12">内存管理会讲到</span><span data-lake-id="u14e4c803" id="u14e4c803" class="lake-fontsize-12">)。</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20a%2C%20b%3B%20%20%2F%2F%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%80%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cnvoid%20func1()%7B%5Cn%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnfloat%20x%2Cy%3B%20%20%2F%2F%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%80%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cnint%20func2()%7B%5Cn%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%7B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%2F*%5Cna%E3%80%81b%E3%80%81x%E3%80%81y%20%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E5%9C%A8%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E7%9A%84%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%80%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E3%80%82%5CnC%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%98%AF%E4%BB%8E%E5%89%8D%E5%BE%80%E5%90%8E%E4%BE%9D%E6%AC%A1%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B1%E4%BA%8E%20x%E3%80%81y%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%9C%A8%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%20func1()%20%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%80%E4%BB%A5%E5%9C%A8%20func1()%20%E5%86%85%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%EF%BC%9B%5Cn%E8%80%8C%20a%E3%80%81b%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%9C%A8%E6%BA%90%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%80%E5%A4%B4%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%80%E4%BB%A5%E5%9C%A8%20func1()%E3%80%81func2()%20%E5%92%8C%20main()%20%E5%86%85%E9%83%BD%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E3%80%82%5Cn*%2F%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IalHh%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E5%B1%80%E9%83%A8%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E5%92%8C%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%80%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%BC%E5%90%88%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9A%5Cn%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnint%20n%20%3D%2010%3B%20%20%2F%2F%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%80%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cn%5Cnvoid%20func1()%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20n%20%3D%2020%3B%20%20%2F%2F%E5%B1%80%E9%83%A8%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22func1%20n%3A%20%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20n)%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnvoid%20func2(int%20n)%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22func2%20n%3A%20%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20n)%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnvoid%20func3()%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22func3%20n%3A%20%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20n)%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20n%20%3D%2030%3B%20%20%2F%2F%E5%B1%80%E9%83%A8%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cn%20%20%20%20func1()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20func2(n)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20func3()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E5%9D%97%E7%94%B1%7B%7D%E5%8C%85%E5%9B%B4%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20int%20n%20%3D%2040%3B%20%20%2F%2F%E5%B1%80%E9%83%A8%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22block%20n%3A%20%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20n)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22main%20n%3A%20%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20n)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cZjtp%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="e7d36eec1d39950789d0ae76df08cd8c" id="e7d36eec1d39950789d0ae76df08cd8c"><span data-lake-id="u837bc5ef" id="u837bc5ef" class="lake-fontsize-12">由上可知：</span></p><ul list="ua6f14f33"><li fid="u6702013b" data-lake-id="u71cbede5" id="u71cbede5"><span data-lake-id="u193a2e8e" id="u193a2e8e" class="lake-fontsize-12">当全局变量和局部变量同名时，在局部范围内全局变量被“屏蔽”，不再起作用。或者说，变量的使用遵循就近原则，如果在当前作用域中存在同名变量，就不会向更大的作用域中去寻找变量。</span></li><li fid="u6702013b" data-lake-id="uccbff5d0" id="uccbff5d0"><span data-lake-id="u73fa607b" id="u73fa607b" class="lake-fontsize-12"> func3() 输出 10，使用的是全局变量，因为在 func3() 函数中不存在局部变量 n，所以编译器只能到函数外部，也就是全局作用域中去寻找变量 n。</span></li><li fid="u6702013b" data-lake-id="ufdb99197" id="ufdb99197"><span data-lake-id="u4917e1cc" id="u4917e1cc" class="lake-fontsize-12">由{ }包围的代码块也拥有独立的作用域，printf() 使用它自己内部的变量 n，输出 40。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="148ec19b5c6f441e6c90f340a6ac2482" id="148ec19b5c6f441e6c90f340a6ac2482"><span data-lake-id="uf0b785a6" id="uf0b785a6" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><h1 data-lake-id="s5LqV" id="s5LqV"><span data-lake-id="u267ebde4" id="u267ebde4">5.程序终止</span></h1><p data-lake-id="d0371a6bbb3281d01bcff6b762973422" id="d0371a6bbb3281d01bcff6b762973422" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u88957cf0" id="u88957cf0" class="lake-fontsize-12">main 函数返回的值是状态码，在某些操作系统中程序终止时可以检 测到状态码。 如果程序正常终止，main 函数应该返回0 ；为了 表示异常终止，main 函数应该返回非0 的值</span></p><p data-lake-id="b261b7f74341484d3b59d8f10408cf1a" id="b261b7f74341484d3b59d8f10408cf1a" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="ua71ea66a" id="ua71ea66a" class="lake-fontsize-12">在main 函数中执行return 语句是终止程序的一种方法，另一种方 法是调用exit 函数，此函数属于&lt;stdlib.h&gt;,传 递给exit 函数的实际参数和main 函数的返回值具有相同的含义： 两者都说明程序终止时的状态。为了表示正常终止，传递0 </span></p><p data-lake-id="e66df78acd30b3e1f0a23987b9a8c446" id="e66df78acd30b3e1f0a23987b9a8c446"><span data-lake-id="ub59d5339" id="ub59d5339" class="lake-fontsize-12">exit(0);</span></p><p data-lake-id="6ce84a9ef63e836155d3bd3b35e1b4bf" id="6ce84a9ef63e836155d3bd3b35e1b4bf" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="uff3f812e" id="uff3f812e" class="lake-fontsize-12">作为终止程序的方法，return 语句和exit 函数关系紧密,事实上return 表达式     &lt;=&gt;    exit(表达式)</span></p><p data-lake-id="b3bd838749cfad1afebc4c613b861363" id="b3bd838749cfad1afebc4c613b861363" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u11b856b5" id="u11b856b5" class="lake-fontsize-12">return 语句和exit 函数之间的差异是：不管哪个函数调用exit 函数都会导致程序终止，return 语句仅当由main 函数调用时才会导致程序终止。一些程序员只使用exit 函数，以便更容易定位程序 中的全部退出点。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id="I6isf" id="I6isf"><span data-lake-id="u387212fa" id="u387212fa">6.递归函数</span></h1><p data-lake-id="3b698845d5a73886c3883c92ea2c86b8" id="3b698845d5a73886c3883c92ea2c86b8"><span data-lake-id="u875355a2" id="u875355a2" class="lake-fontsize-12">递归概念：如果一个函数内部，包含了对自身的调用，则该函数称为递归函数。</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22func()%5Cn%5Ct%7B%5Cn%5Ct%5Ctfunc()%5Cn%5Ct%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22P2e3J%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="1fd45bb47f67ddc9bf9f9029dff50b61" id="1fd45bb47f67ddc9bf9f9029dff50b61"><span data-lake-id="u26c4541b" id="u26c4541b" class="lake-fontsize-12">递归问题：</span></p><ul list="u774bc153"><li fid="ubf608958" data-lake-id="uf99131f6" id="uf99131f6"><span data-lake-id="u30682a8a" id="u30682a8a" class="lake-fontsize-12">阶乘。</span></li><li fid="ubf608958" data-lake-id="u46893bf6" id="u46893bf6"><span data-lake-id="u11ab0a1f" id="u11ab0a1f" class="lake-fontsize-12">幂运算。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="1c3c6f5a9a81547aca3afc5deea67b18" id="1c3c6f5a9a81547aca3afc5deea67b18"><span data-lake-id="u388afac3" id="u388afac3" class="lake-fontsize-12">要点：</span></p><ul list="ubc48d38a"><li fid="u6e9179a6" data-lake-id="u1d6903f0" id="u1d6903f0"><span data-lake-id="ua2e0d05e" id="ua2e0d05e" class="lake-fontsize-12">只有能被表达为递归的问题，才能用递归函数解决。</span></li><li fid="u6e9179a6" data-lake-id="u91ca25cd" id="u91ca25cd"><span data-lake-id="u706921c1" id="u706921c1" class="lake-fontsize-12">递归函数必须有一个可直接退出的条件，否则会进入无限递归。</span></li><li fid="u6e9179a6" data-lake-id="ue2868158" id="ue2868158"><span data-lake-id="u9c4bf5c1" id="u9c4bf5c1" class="lake-fontsize-12">递归函数包含两个过程，一个逐渐递进的过程，和一个逐渐回归的过程。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6f0df181" id="u6f0df181"><span data-lake-id="uf956bca8" id="uf956bca8" class="lake-fontsize-12">demo：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnvoid%20func(int%20n)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E9%80%92%E5%BD%92%E9%80%80%E5%87%BA%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%5Cn%20%20%20%20if(n%20%3D%3D%206)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20func(%2B%2Bn)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C--n)%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnint%20main(int%20argc%2C%20char%20const%20*argv%5B%5D)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20n%20%3D%201%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20func(n)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RWDPg%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="u7bfc58c8" id="u7bfc58c8"><span data-lake-id="ueb2c7741" id="ueb2c7741" class="lake-fontsize-12">demo2：//求结果</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnint%20func(int%20n)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E9%80%80%E5%87%BA%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%5Cn%20%20%20%20if(n%20%3D%3D%201)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%201%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20func(n-1)*n%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnint%20main(int%20argc%2C%20char%20const%20*argv%5B%5D)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20n%20%3D%20func(4)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cn)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zTEZ8%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="96dd52cbb47fab8b7b29c304f2b077b5" id="96dd52cbb47fab8b7b29c304f2b077b5"><span data-lake-id="uf0c81e6c" id="uf0c81e6c" class="lake-fontsize-12">示例：依次输出 n 个自然数。</span></p><p data-lake-id="935399613f7733a9f69b2c5545880f8c" id="935399613f7733a9f69b2c5545880f8c"><span data-lake-id="u1e93d72e" id="u1e93d72e" class="lake-fontsize-12">思路：先输出前面的 n-1 个自然数，再输出最后一个自然数 n 。而要输出前面的  n-1 个自然数，递归调用自身即可。</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2F%20%E8%AF%A5%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%EF%BC%9A%E4%BE%9D%E6%AC%A1%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%20n%20%E4%B8%AA%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E6%95%B0%5Cnvoid%20f(int%20n)%20%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20if(n%20%3C%200)%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%201%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93%E6%BB%A1%E8%B6%B3%E6%AD%A4%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E9%80%92%E5%BD%92%E3%80%82%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20f(n-1)%3B%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%202%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%92%E5%BD%92%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%EF%BC%8C%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E5%89%8D%20n-1%20%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%B0%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20n)%3B%20%2F%2F%203%EF%BC%8C%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E6%95%B0%20n%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sBYss%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="427051aed2911cedefe0e5749cd70455" id="427051aed2911cedefe0e5749cd70455"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E7%BB%83%E4%B9%A0%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22xZaew%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="ub5c7ae0c" id="ub5c7ae0c" class="lake-fontsize-12">：实现幂运算</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oktDz%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="d73dd62f4853dc62b824e74685327161" id="d73dd62f4853dc62b824e74685327161"><span data-lake-id="u51477b48" id="u51477b48" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F*%5Cn%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%97%E7%9A%84%E6%AF%8F%E4%BD%8D%E4%B9%8B%E5%92%8C%EF%BC%88%E9%80%92%E5%BD%92%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%EF%BC%89%5Cn%E4%BE%8B%E5%A6%82%EF%BC%9A%5Cn%E9%80%92%E5%BD%92%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0a(n)%2C%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8a(256)%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%99%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E2%2B5%2B6%E7%9A%84%E5%92%8C%E4%B8%BA13%20%20%5Cn*%2F%5Cn%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cnint%20sum(int%20n)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20while%20(n%3E9)%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20%20n%2510%20%2B%20sum(n%2F10)%3B%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20if(n%3C%3D9)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20n%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn%5Cnint%20main%20()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20n%20%3D0%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20scanf(%5C%22%25d%5C%22%2C%26n)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20ret%20%3D%20sum(n)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cret)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fMhEo%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="c9f832bc832cfe31a9baa3d6425ef985" id="c9f832bc832cfe31a9baa3d6425ef985" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u845a4c2a" id="u845a4c2a" class="lake-fontsize-12">递归调用时，随着递归函数的层层深入，栈空间逐渐往下增长，如果递归的层次太深，很容易把栈内存耗光。</span></p><p data-lake-id="681f9b5123c85d77b278bbec1ebb2143" id="681f9b5123c85d77b278bbec1ebb2143" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="ueaee323e" id="ueaee323e" class="lake-fontsize-12">层层递进时，问题的规模会随之减小，减小到可直接退出的条件时，函数开始层层回归。</span></p><p data-lake-id="7cd73f93d2e90a063650170d26f8e6d4" id="7cd73f93d2e90a063650170d26f8e6d4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560136099-46216b01-1b6e-435c-8a77-0838deefac29.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A360%2C%22originHeight%22%3A219%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6f6f6%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aqnh7%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="3a6ce41a9b190276515f7765da7373cb" id="3a6ce41a9b190276515f7765da7373cb" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u04af5187" id="u04af5187" class="lake-fontsize-12">递归调用时栈内存的变化</span></p><h1 data-lake-id="COMZK" id="COMZK"><span data-lake-id="u87438487" id="u87438487">7.main函数命令行参数</span></h1><p data-lake-id="88963b4d9992a01337ac697d947bbd0c" id="88963b4d9992a01337ac697d947bbd0c" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u2438047c" id="u2438047c" class="lake-fontsize-12">C语言中 main 函数称之为主函数，操作系统总是将 main 函数作为应用程序的开始，将 main 函数的返回值作为程序的退出状态</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2Fmain%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E6%9C%89%E6%97%B6%E5%80%99%E4%BC%9A%E5%86%99%E5%87%BA%E8%BF%99%E6%A0%B7%E5%AD%90%5Cn%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cnint%20main(int%20argc%2Cchar*%20argv%5B%5D)%5Cn%7B%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wNUFj%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="19a2703ced5ace3e994b2071bdbf44da" id="19a2703ced5ace3e994b2071bdbf44da" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="ufcbdcccf" id="ufcbdcccf" class="lake-fontsize-12">我们给main函数传递两个参数，argc和argv。</span></p><ul list="u8c6814da"><li fid="u1f04d46d" data-lake-id="u6772289b" id="u6772289b"><span data-lake-id="u32f20ccb" id="u32f20ccb" class="lake-fontsize-12">argc是int类型的，它表示的是命令行参数的个数。不需要用户传递，它会根据用户从命令行输入的参数个数，自动确定。</span></li><li fid="u1f04d46d" data-lake-id="u0be79c15" id="u0be79c15"><span data-lake-id="u1273dcf2" id="u1273dcf2" class="lake-fontsize-12">argv 它的作用是存储用户从命令行传递进来的参数。它的第一个成员是用户运行的程序名字</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="b81148932584ccee8733855fb9a64579" id="b81148932584ccee8733855fb9a64579"><span data-lake-id="u45014ae6" id="u45014ae6" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2Fmain.c%5Cn%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnint%20main(int%20argc%2Cchar*%20argv%5B%5D)%20%20%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22argc%3A%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cargc)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20i%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20for(i%3D0%3Bi%3Cargc%3Bi%2B%2B)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cargv%5Bi%5D)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RHGFj%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="83460a72e8df9eaf09af41d10f52a6f0" id="83460a72e8df9eaf09af41d10f52a6f0" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u9e413b97" id="u9e413b97" class="lake-fontsize-12">通过命令行参数，程序可以根据用户的需求动态地调整其行为。例如，可以通过不同的命令行参数来指定程序的输入文件、输出文件。在编写命令行工具时，命令行参数也是很重要的。用户可以通过不同的命令行参数来指定不同的操作和选项</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22gcc%20main.c%5Cn.%2Fa.exe%202%20jack%20rose%5Cn%5Cn----%3E%5Cn2%5Cnjack%5Cnros%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Dytw7%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h1 data-lake-id="zTJzr" id="zTJzr"><span data-lake-id="u7f77b129" id="u7f77b129">8.函数指针</span></h1><p data-lake-id="c8269fbda13ce8013a1f3e2216f2a5e2" id="c8269fbda13ce8013a1f3e2216f2a5e2"><span data-lake-id="ue84d48c0" id="ue84d48c0" class="lake-fontsize-12">函数指针是指向函数的指针变量。</span></p><p data-lake-id="443a689ac69162c0dcad6aa7a6b82797" id="443a689ac69162c0dcad6aa7a6b82797"><span data-lake-id="u2e6c7146" id="u2e6c7146" class="lake-fontsize-12">函数指针跟普通指针本质上并无区别，</span><span data-lake-id="uf97ee809" id="uf97ee809" class="lake-fontsize-12">只是在取址和索引时，取址符和星号均可省略</span></p><ul list="ub447abaa"><li fid="u0f228c34" data-lake-id="u4be5a140" id="u4be5a140" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="uc0341659" id="uc0341659" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">函数指针变量，就是用来保存函数地址的变量</span></li><li fid="u0f228c34" data-lake-id="u796882d2" id="u796882d2" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ue26afe2c" id="ue26afe2c" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">函数名相当于这个函数的首地址</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7006f661" id="u7006f661"><br></p><p data-lake-id="2f5529c999b5591a9372311ce1f47199" id="2f5529c999b5591a9372311ce1f47199"><span data-lake-id="u3aef3a1a" id="u3aef3a1a" class="lake-fontsize-12">函数指针的定义方式为：</span></p><ul list="u37f161a7"><li fid="u75361913" data-lake-id="ub79b871c" id="ub79b871c"><span data-lake-id="u422d60b3" id="u422d60b3" class="lake-fontsize-12">函数返回值类型 (* 指针变量名) (函数参数列表);</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud471fa22" id="ud471fa22"><br></p><p data-lake-id="96f56c551dfae63385eac85796957f7d" id="96f56c551dfae63385eac85796957f7d"><span data-lake-id="u1bd260a2" id="u1bd260a2" class="lake-fontsize-12">“函数返回值类型”表示该指针变量可以指向具有什么返回值类型的函数；“函数参数列表”表示该指针变量可以指向具有什么参数列表的函数。这个参数列表中只需要写函数的参数类型即可。</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnvoid%20f(int%20a)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Ca)%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cnint%20main(int%20argc%2C%20char%20const%20*argv%5B%5D)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20void%20(*p)(int)%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%20p%20%E4%B8%93%E9%97%A8%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E4%B8%BA%20void%20(int)%20%E7%9A%84%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2Fp%20%3D%20%26f%3B%20%2F%2F%20p%20%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%20f%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%96%E5%9D%80%E7%AC%A6%26%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%9C%81%E7%95%A5%EF%BC%89%5Cn%20%20%20%20p%20%3D%20f%3B%20%20%2F%2F%20p%20%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%20f%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%AA%E5%BC%8F%E5%AD%90%E6%98%AF%E7%AD%89%E4%BB%B7%E7%9A%84%EF%BC%9A%5Cn%20%20%20%20f(666)%3B%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%20f%5Cn%20%20%20%20(*p)(666)%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E7%B4%A2%E5%BC%95%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%20p%20%E7%9A%84%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%EF%BC%8C%E9%97%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%20f%5Cn%20%20%20%20p(666)%3B%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%E5%9C%A8%E7%B4%A2%E5%BC%95%E5%85%B6%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%9F%E5%8F%B7%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%9C%81%E7%95%A5%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c9XZb%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="6fc3609146b83b04b08e0a64786a654b" id="6fc3609146b83b04b08e0a64786a654b"><span data-lake-id="u696d5acf" id="u696d5acf" class="lake-fontsize-12">demo：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2Fdemo%EF%BC%9A%5Cn%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%2F%2F%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E7%A7%8D%5Cntypedef%20int%20int32_t%3B%5Cn%2F%2F%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E7%A7%8D%5Cntypedef%20void%20(*fptr)(int%20*a%2C%20int%20*b)%3B%2F%2F%20%E7%B1%BB%E4%BC%BC%E4%BA%8E%20int%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%20int%20a%20%3D%2010%5Cntypedef%20int%20(*fMaxPtr)(int%2Cint)%3B%2F%2F%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%AA%E5%86%99%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%5Cn%5Cnvoid%20swap(int%20*a%2C%20int%20*b)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20temp%20%3D%20*a%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20*a%20%3D%20*b%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20*b%20%3D%20temp%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnint%20max(int%20a%2C%20int%20b)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20a%20%3E%20b%20%3F%20a%20%3A%20b%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnint%20main(int%20argc%2C%20char%20const%20*argv%5B%5D)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20a%20%3D%2010%20%2C%20b%20%3D%2020%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91swap%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8Fpfunc%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%E7%9A%84%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E4%B8%8E%E6%89%80%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E7%9A%84%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%B0%86%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%90%8D%E5%8E%BB%E6%8E%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%89%A9%E4%B8%8B%E7%9A%84%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E4%B8%BA%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E7%9A%84%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%5Cn%20%20%20%20void%20(*pfunc)(int%20*a%2C%20int%20*b)%20%3D%20swap%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25p%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cswap)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25p%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cpfunc)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%202.%20%E5%B0%86%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%E6%94%B9%E5%88%AB%E5%90%8D%5Cn%20%20%20%20fptr%20p%20%3D%20swap%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25p%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cp)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8Cswap%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2Fp(%26a%2C%26b)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20pfunc(%26a%2C%26b)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%2C%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Ca%2Cb)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91max%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E6%AF%94%E8%BE%83%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E5%80%BC%5Cn%20%20%20%20fMaxPtr%20fmax%20%3D%20max%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22max%20%3D%20%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cfmax(19%2C29))%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KUE2Q%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="ff3cb57faa222e8d2f0f493dfa860b2c" id="ff3cb57faa222e8d2f0f493dfa860b2c"><span data-lake-id="ud291e561" id="ud291e561" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><h1 data-lake-id="FITfg" id="FITfg"><span data-lake-id="ub3eb00a2" id="ub3eb00a2">9.回调函数</span></h1><p data-lake-id="eef37f3c124be6170e00b79109eb28bc" id="eef37f3c124be6170e00b79109eb28bc" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u32793b07" id="u32793b07" class="lake-fontsize-12">回调函数是 C 语言中函数指针的一种用法，在一个函数A中通过函数指针调用另一个函数B的过程称为回调（callback）</span></p><p data-lake-id="u100fbf15" id="u100fbf15" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u26039218" id="u26039218" class="lake-fontsize-12">通过函数指针被调用的函数B就是回调函数。回调让函数 B 的代码更加泛化和抽象，增强了程序的灵活性和可维护性。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u210fe2d8" id="u210fe2d8"><span data-lake-id="u021c1feb" id="u021c1feb" class="lake-fontsize-12">demo：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%9B%9E%E8%B0%83%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%EF%BC%8C%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%B4%E6%95%B0%E5%B9%B6%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%B4%E6%95%B0%5Cntypedef%20int%20(*Operation)(int%2C%20int)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E5%8A%A0%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%9E%E8%B0%83%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cnint%20add(int%20a%2C%20int%20b)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20a%20%2B%20b%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E5%87%8F%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%9E%E8%B0%83%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cnint%20subtract(int%20a%2C%20int%20b)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20a%20-%20b%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%9A%84%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%EF%BC%8C%E6%8E%A5%E6%94%B6%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%B4%E6%95%B0%E5%92%8C%E5%9B%9E%E8%B0%83%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cnint%20do_operation(int%20x%2C%20int%20y%2C%20Operation%20op)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20op(x%2C%20y)%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20a%20%3D%2010%2C%20b%20%3D%205%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%8A%A0%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%9E%E8%B0%83%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20sum%20%3D%20do_operation(a%2C%20b%2C%20add)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22Sum%3A%20%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20sum)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%87%8F%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%9E%E8%B0%83%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20difference%20%3D%20do_operation(a%2C%20b%2C%20subtract)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22Difference%3A%20%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20difference)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22W2XeS%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="f95130eeaafce6cdbbe17ba8856f721a" id="f95130eeaafce6cdbbe17ba8856f721a" style="text-indent: 2em"><span data-lake-id="u85decd71" id="u85decd71" class="lake-fontsize-12">你现在需要写一个视频播放器项目，当视频播放结束后通知用户当前视频已经播放完成！</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%23include%20%3Cstdlib.h%3E%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%E5%9B%9E%E8%B0%83%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B01%5Cnint%20playBegin(char%20*%20content)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Ccontent)%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%2F%2F%E5%9B%9E%E8%B0%83%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B02%5Cnint%20playIng(char%20*%20content)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Ccontent)%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%2F%2F%E5%9B%9E%E8%B0%83%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B03%5Cnint%20playEnd(char%20*%20content)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25s%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Ccontent)%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%2F%2F%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%5Cnint%20play(int%20(*callBackFunc)(char*%20)%2C%20char*%20name)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20callBackFunc(name)%3B%2F%2F%E3%80%8A----%E3%80%8BplayBegin%EF%BC%88name%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%9B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20(*pbegin)(char*%20)%3DplayBegin%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20(*playing)(char*%20)%3DplayIng%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20(*pend)(char*%20)%3DplayEnd%3B%2F%2F%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%AA%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20p_playbegin%5B64%5D%20%3D%20%5C%22%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E8%A7%A3%E7%A0%81%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%B3%E5%B0%86%E5%87%BA%E7%8E%B0%E7%94%BB%E9%9D%A2....%5C%22%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20p_playing%5B1024%5D%20%3D%20%5C%22%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E4%B8%83%E5%9B%9E%20%E3%80%8A%E5%B0%B8%E9%AD%94%E4%B8%89%E6%88%8F%E5%94%90%E4%B8%89%E8%97%8F%EF%BC%8C%E5%9C%A3%E5%83%A7%E6%81%A8%E9%80%90%E7%BE%8E%E7%8C%B4%E7%8E%8B%E3%80%8B%5C%22%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20p_playend%5B64%5D%20%3D%20%5C%22%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91%E6%92%AD%E6%94%BE%E7%BB%93%E6%9D%9F....%5C%22%3B%2F%2F%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%AA%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91%E6%92%AD%E6%94%BE%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B....%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%EF%BC%8C%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20play(pbegin%2Cp_playbegin)%3B%2F%2Fpbegin%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E4%BC%A0%E9%80%92%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91%E6%92%AD%E6%94%BE%E4%B8%AD....%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20play(playing%2Cp_playing)%3B%2F%2Fplaying%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E4%BC%A0%E9%80%92%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91%E6%92%AD%E6%94%BE%E7%BB%93%E6%9D%9F....%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20play(pend%2Cp_playend)%3B%2F%2Fpend%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E4%BC%A0%E9%80%92%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%2F*%5Cn%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E8%A7%A3%E7%A0%81%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%B3%E5%B0%86%E5%87%BA%E7%8E%B0%E7%94%BB%E9%9D%A2....%5Cn%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E4%B8%83%E5%9B%9E%20%E3%80%8A%E5%B0%B8%E9%AD%94%E4%B8%89%E6%88%8F%E5%94%90%E4%B8%89%E8%97%8F%EF%BC%8C%E5%9C%A3%E5%83%A7%E6%81%A8%E9%80%90%E7%BE%8E%E7%8C%B4%E7%8E%8B%E3%80%8B%5Cn%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91%E6%92%AD%E6%94%BE%E7%BB%93%E6%9D%9F....%5Cn*%2F%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NDPqE%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="3b2808a53f3584703b702afe1a3ccc81" id="3b2808a53f3584703b702afe1a3ccc81" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560136332-5c2db5e0-8ae1-43ac-9e0e-e585b92bf0a9.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A450%2C%22height%22%3A193%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1025%2C%22originHeight%22%3A440%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f9f9%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sjxQ5%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="c583851546d6d9650aca4be4225081ce" id="c583851546d6d9650aca4be4225081ce"><span data-lake-id="uf14c8daf" id="uf14c8daf" class="lake-fontsize-12">只要我们改变传进库函数的参数，就可以实现不同的功能</span></p><p data-lake-id="u60b3ac8c" id="u60b3ac8c"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22S6uQW%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="u9b5a8cf2" id="u9b5a8cf2" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u1dd1b5b1" id="u1dd1b5b1"><span data-lake-id="ub37948d6" id="ub37948d6">函数模块化处理</span></p><ol list="ucdc682b4"><li fid="u5d847b29" data-lake-id="ue7a97a03" id="ue7a97a03"><span data-lake-id="uca205cc2" id="uca205cc2" class="lake-fontsize-12">一个工程应该是有多个c文件以及头文件组成</span></li><li fid="u5d847b29" data-lake-id="u9e4c8468" id="u9e4c8468"><span data-lake-id="uaefcd311" id="uaefcd311" class="lake-fontsize-12">c文件用于存放自己封装的函数接口或者动静态库</span></li><li fid="u5d847b29" data-lake-id="uc7814cd3" id="uc7814cd3"><span data-lake-id="ubd3567a6" id="ubd3567a6">头文件用于存放函数的声明以及各种结构体，宏，枚举的定义</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id="ud31c2cf3" id="ud31c2cf3"><span data-lake-id="u3cd40b1b" id="u3cd40b1b" class="lake-fontsize-12">封装流程：</span></p><ol list="ua6f473ed"><li fid="u473893f9" data-lake-id="u4ae19e40" id="u4ae19e40"><span data-lake-id="ucfbee760" id="ucfbee760" class="lake-fontsize-12">创建工程目录用于存放项目 </span></li><li fid="u473893f9" data-lake-id="uaf17f0dd" id="uaf17f0dd"><span data-lake-id="udc976ec1" id="udc976ec1" class="lake-fontsize-12">再此工程目录下创建 add.c main.c add.h</span></li></ol><ol list="ua6f473ed" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="ub44274ae" data-lake-id="ub17abefa" id="ub17abefa"><span data-lake-id="ub7ca9b3f" id="ub7ca9b3f" class="lake-fontsize-12">add.c 是存放功能算法</span></li><li fid="ub44274ae" data-lake-id="u73f0255e" id="u73f0255e"><span data-lake-id="u765dd433" id="u765dd433" class="lake-fontsize-12">main.c 主函数实现</span></li><li fid="ub44274ae" data-lake-id="u2ab13296" id="u2ab13296"><span data-lake-id="uada03c24" id="uada03c24" class="lake-fontsize-12">add.h是功能算法的函数声明</span></li></ol><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2Fadd.c%5Cn%23include%20%3Cstdbool.h%3E%5Cn%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnvoid%20add(int%20a%2C%20int%20b)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Ca)%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YyGNi%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2Fmain.c%5Cn%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%23include%20%3Cstdbool.h%3E%5Cn%5Cn%23include%20%5C%22add.h%5C%22%5Cn%5Cnint%20main(int%20argc%2C%20char%20const%20*argv%5B%5D)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20a%20%3D%2010%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20b%20%3D%209%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20add(a%2Cb)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qpHnw%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2Fadd.h%5Cn%23ifndef%20_ADD_H%5Cn%23define%20_ADD_H%5Cn%5Cnvoid%20add(int%20a%2C%20int%20b)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%23endif%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cv9TV%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%EF%BC%9A%5Cn%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%BF%AB%E6%8D%B7%E9%94%AE%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%5Cn%5Cngcc%20main.c%20add.c%20-o%20main.exe%5Cn%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%5Cn.%2Fmain.exe%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NWMKX%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h1 data-lake-id="Yk2SI" id="Yk2SI"><span data-lake-id="u148d933d" id="u148d933d">10、内联函数 inline</span></h1><ul list="uf0410ffc"><li fid="u959cd457" data-lake-id="u1bd5ea11" id="u1bd5ea11"><span data-lake-id="u786fdd51" id="u786fdd51" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">内联的特性 ：</span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)"><u><span data-lake-id="ue2b0d403" id="ue2b0d403" class="lake-fontsize-12">以空间换时间</span></u></span></li><li fid="u959cd457" data-lake-id="u89e80626" id="u89e80626"><span data-lake-id="ue00bb900" id="ue00bb900" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">当编译器发现某段代码有inline关键字的时候就会将这段代码插入到当前的位置，加快运行效率，但是也会消耗一定的运行空间</span></li><li fid="u959cd457" data-lake-id="u23812145" id="u23812145"><span data-lake-id="u22d59a6e" id="u22d59a6e" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">什么时候用inline</span></li></ul><ol list="ue5774504" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="uf25f06a4" data-lake-id="u330b0b0f" id="u330b0b0f"><span data-lake-id="u2e481de4" id="u2e481de4" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">函数需要频繁被调用，代码最好不要超过5行</span></li></ol><ul list="uf0410ffc" start="4"><li fid="u959cd457" data-lake-id="u0640872c" id="u0640872c"><span data-lake-id="u8e26689d" id="u8e26689d" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">inline注意事项</span></li></ul><ul list="uf0410ffc" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="uae388a0b" data-lake-id="ud1542261" id="ud1542261"><span data-lake-id="u7ecd1afe" id="u7ecd1afe" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">内联函数在头文件实现，其它函数不要在头文件实现</span></li><li fid="uae388a0b" data-lake-id="ud75f0c87" id="ud75f0c87"><span data-lake-id="u90a410db" id="u90a410db" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">函数声明和函数实现都需要添加关键字inline，如果函数声明没有添加extern 和 inline 关键字,会报错</span></li></ul><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2F%20%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BAmain.c%5Cn%5Cn%23include%20%5C%22add.h%5C%22%5Cn%5Cninline%20int%20add(int%20a%2C%20int%20b)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20a%2Bb%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnint%20main(int%20argc%2C%20char%20const%20*argv%5B%5D)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2Cadd(10%2C20))%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KL83P%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2F%20%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BAadd.h%E5%A4%B4%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%5Cn%5Cn%23ifndef%20_ADD_H%5Cn%23define%20_ADD_H%5Cn%5Cn%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E5%86%85%E8%81%94%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E%5Cnextern%20inline%20int%20add(int%20a%2C%20int%20b)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%23endif%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BZtuI%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E8%8B%A5%E7%94%A8%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%5Cngcc%20main.c%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FoFSs%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h1 data-lake-id="X8PYM" id="X8PYM"><span data-lake-id="ue5b6128f" id="ue5b6128f">11.问与答</span></h1><ol list="uabdaf82f"><li fid="ub9359016" data-lake-id="u40a8642e" id="u40a8642e"><span data-lake-id="u58b31d5d" id="u58b31d5d" class="lake-fontsize-12">我不明白为什么要提供函数原型。只要把所有函数的定义 放置在main 函数的前面，不就没有问题了吗？</span></li></ol><ul list="u63ddfb4c"><li fid="u131b55cd" data-lake-id="uf744f2c4" id="uf744f2c4"><span data-lake-id="u5828d3db" id="u5828d3db" class="lake-fontsize-12">这么想是错误的，首先你是假设只有main 函数调用其他函数，实际上，某些函数将会相互调用。如果把所有的函数定义 放在main 的上面，就必须仔细斟酌它们之间的顺序，假设有两个函数相互调用，无论先定义哪个函数，都将导致对未定义的函数的调用，此外，一旦程序达到一定的规模，在一个文件中 放置所有的函数是不可行的。当遇到这种情况时，就需要函数原型告 诉编译器在其他文件中定义的函数（15章会学习）。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="5b6d77e2bbdc2433907d2fc6f06db25b" id="5b6d77e2bbdc2433907d2fc6f06db25b"><span data-lake-id="u6994931a" id="u6994931a" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><ol list="uabdaf82f" start="2"><li fid="ub9359016" data-lake-id="u1ae452c3" id="u1ae452c3"><span data-lake-id="u89e672b1" id="u89e672b1" class="lake-fontsize-12">为什么有的程序员在函数原型中故意省略参数名字？保留这些 名字不是更方便吗？</span></li></ol><ul list="u0a84b5e6"><li fid="u1109a6f7" data-lake-id="ud5d55c06" id="ud5d55c06"><span data-lake-id="u78c0fd60" id="u78c0fd60" class="lake-fontsize-12">省略原型中的参数名字通常是出于防御目的。如果恰好有一个宏的名字跟参数一样，预处理时参数的名字会被替换，从而导致相应的 原型被破坏</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="f85d750732898a0aad4c6b662bc42c0e" id="f85d750732898a0aad4c6b662bc42c0e"><span data-lake-id="u57f614d6" id="u57f614d6" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><ol list="uabdaf82f" start="3"><li fid="ub9359016" data-lake-id="u974fa4af" id="u974fa4af"><span data-lake-id="u7f8f8800" id="u7f8f8800" class="lake-fontsize-12">非void 函数没有return会怎么样？</span></li></ol><ul list="u11e7ff49"><li fid="u782fb159" data-lake-id="u1dfc0b8a" id="u1dfc0b8a"><span data-lake-id="uedd7b96d" id="uedd7b96d" class="lake-fontsize-12">在C99中， main 函数的最后可以不返回值，标准规定在这种情况下main 自动 返回0</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u03d741f8" id="u03d741f8"><br></p>